          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "As a result, humans have learned to respect feline independence.",
      "translation": "因此，人类已经学会尊重猫的独立性。",
      "startTime": 33.63,
      "endTime": 39.35,
